cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use jnwb, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "jnwb: analysis operations for Neurodata Without Borders electrophysiology"
abstract: >-
  jnwb is a Python toolbox for analysing Neurodata Without Borders (NWB)
  electrophysiology data: composable, tested operations over NWB files, arrays
  and metadata, usable directly or by coding agents through skills.
authors:
